      "dcterms:title": "RSSEV",
      "dcterms:description": "Tick-borne encephalitis virus, strain RSSE (Far eastern subspecies) original isolate. This Tick-borne encephalitis virus[RSSE] is preserved under Viral Storage Medium -80C.Tests for the presence of mycoplasmae were negative. To confirm its identity the virus has been partly sequenced.",
