      "EVORAO:infectivityTest": "Infectivity was proven by plaque titration. Infectious titre was determined to be 9x 10^7 PFU/ml.",
      "EVORAO:mycoplasmicContent": "Mycoplasma free",
      "EVORAO:passage": "Passaged 6 times on suckling mice in 1993 and stored freeze-dried. New stock prepared by one passage on Vero E6 cells on 11th August 2011.",
