      "dcterms:title": "CHIKUNROSS",
      "dcterms:description": "Chikungunya virus, strain Ross original isolate. This Chikungunya virus[Ross] is preserved under Viral Storage Medium -80C.Tests for the presence of mycoplasmae were negative. To confirm its identity the virus has been partly sequenced.",
