      "dcterms:title": "TBEV - Hypr",
      "dcterms:description": "Tick-borne encephalitis virus, strain Hypr original isolate. This Tick-borne encephalitis virus[Hypr] is preserved under Viral Storage Medium -80C.Tests for the presence of mycoplasmae were negative. To confirm its identity the virus has been partly sequenced.",
      "EVORAO:unitDefinition": "1 ml (2 vials of 0,5ml)",
      "EVORAO:category": {
