      "EVORAO:shippingConditions": "Dry ice",
      "EVORAO:storageConditions": "Viral Storage Medium -80C",
      "EVORAO:technicalRecommendation": "We recommend to grow the virus on VeroE6 cells cultivated in MEM Eagle with Earle\"s BSS (BioWhittaker, 12-136F). Following additives should be added to 500 ml of medium: 5ml Nonesential amino acids (Biochrom AG, K0293), 5 ml Sodium Pyruvate 100mM, (Biochrom AG, L0473), 5 ml L-Alanyl-L-glutamine 200mM (Biochrom AG, K0302), 5 ml Penicilin/ Streptomycin/ Amphotericin (BioWhittaker 17-745E), 25 ml FBS heat inact.s.American (Invitrogen, 10108-165). \r\nMultiplicity of infection (MOI) of  0,001 can be used for the infection and the infectious medium can be harvested 72hours after infection.",
      "EVORAO:titer": "1000000 PFU/ml",
      "EVORAO:cultivability": "Cultivable virus",
